&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Activation Director&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;a pivotal role in our Activation team, tasked with leading a top-tier team to deliver exceptional media solutions. This individual will work under the Head of Activation, managing a specific agency/business&amp;nbsp;area&amp;nbsp;and spearheading cross-channel campaigns to achieve outstanding results for our clients.&amp;nbsp;The&amp;nbsp;role involves collaboration with both onshore and offshore specialists.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
