&lt;h2&gt;Who Are We?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RZR is an AI-native advertising platform built for the next era of performance marketing. We operate at the intersection of machine learning, programmatic media, and full-funnel mobile growth, powering campaigns for some of the world&#39;s most ambitious advertisers. Our platform is purpose-built to deliver outcomes at scale, not just impressions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a team of builders, operators, and technologists who believe the advertising industry is overdue for a fundamental rethink. We move fast, operate with a high degree of ownership, and hold ourselves to an exceptionally high standard of craft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RZR is scaling aggressively with an active M&amp;amp;A pipeline and a platform vision that puts us on a path to becoming an industry leader. This is a rare opportunity to join a company at an inflection point and help shape what it becomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Growth Manager based in London, you will own a portfolio of strategically significant accounts across the UK and Western EMEA, driving revenue retention and growth for some of the most commercially important relationships in the region. This is a senior individual contributor role. You will operate with full autonomy from day one: leading your own growth plans, managing executive-level client relationships, and executing across the full account lifecycle without co-management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with cross-functional teams across Growth, Analytics, and Operations to launch and optimize campaigns, surface performance insights, and translate data into decisions that move the business. You will report to the EMEA Growth lead and collaborate with a lean, senior team that moves fast and holds itself to a high standard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the heart of RZR&#39;s EMEA strategy. The region manages a combined book of over $110K DRR across 30+ accounts, with a strong new business pipeline, and we need a senior operator who can own a meaningful portion of that portfolio independently and grow it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Revenue Retention &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive net growth to meet or exceed revenue targets across your assigned portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and close upsell and cross-sell opportunities while actively managing churn risk and re-activation plays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive product adoption and expansion to increase revenue quality and account depth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively surface client needs and gaps to inform both account strategy and commercial planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Client Ownership &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead account retention and growth plans with a multi-quarter forward view and clear, measurable milestones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong client relationships at all levels, from performance marketers to C-suite stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use QBRs and strategic sessions to drive progress, deepen engagement, and secure long-term commitment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate product capabilities and market changes in ways that are clear, compelling, and directly relevant to each client&#39;s business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide market insights and best practices that position RZR as a strategic partner, not just a vendor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Campaign Management &amp;amp; Performance Insights&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with internal teams to launch, execute, and optimize campaigns aligned to client goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor account health and identify performance issues before they become client concerns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver actionable insights tied to business impact, not just metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recommend creative and strategy adjustments to counter performance fatigue and sustain growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional coordination to meet client expectations and execute growth plans on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear escalation paths to resolve issues quickly and protect the client relationship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct client training sessions, platform walkthroughs, and onboarding as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Operational Excellence&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate forecasting, pipeline documentation, and reporting with full personal accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure financial alignment including timely invoicing and budget tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report accurately and consistently to regional EMEA and global leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required Skills and Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 to 5 years of experience in mobile advertising, including at least 3 years in a client-facing growth or account management role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid working knowledge of the programmatic advertising ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the UK market; established relationships with key advertisers and agencies across the UK and Western EMEA are a significant advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build high-touch client relationships, manage in-person engagements, and calibrate the right frequency and depth of contact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of independently managing and scaling commercial accounts, identifying and closing upsell and cross-sell opportunities without hand-holding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable managing the full account lifecycle in a commercially dense, competitive market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel regularly and engage clients and team members in person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt quickly in a high-growth environment and lead growth initiatives with limited structural support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills, able to engage confidently with clients from campaign managers to C-level executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaborator across diverse, globally distributed teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data analytics, machine learning, and advertising technology is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English; an additional European language is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join RZR in London?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step into direct ownership of a commercially significant EMEA portfolio from day one: full autonomy, full accountability, and no co-management required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a privacy-centric, AI-driven programmatic platform as the UK market deepens and the product portfolio (User Acquisition, Retargeting, CTV) actively expands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Earn a competitive base salary plus a structured commission plan where your performance directly determines your earnings ceiling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain exposure to global advertisers, senior cross-functional teams, and major industry events across EMEA and beyond, with regular in-person client engagement built into the role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a small, senior team where your contributions are visible, your voice carries weight, and direct access to leadership accelerates your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Values&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RZR operates by eight core behaviours: Extreme Ownership · Move Fast · Drive for Excellence · Proactive Communication · Courage · Curiosity · Deliver Results · Manage Ambiguity&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Endor Labs is building the Application Security platform for the software development revolution. Modern software is complex and dependency-rich, making it increasingly difficult to pinpoint the risks that truly matter. Endor Labs solves this challenge by building a call graph of your entire software estate—enabling teams to clearly identify, prioritize, and fix critical risks faster.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trusted by companies that are one or one hundred years old, Endor Labs secures code whether it was written by humans or AI, and whether it&#39;s 40-year old C++ code or cutting edge Bazel Monorepos. Endor Labs was founded by serial entrepreneurs Varun Badhwar and Dimitri Stiliadis, and is backed by leading VC firms such as Dell Technology Capital, Lightspeed, and Sierra Ventures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sound interesting? Let’s talk if you want to be part of the next big leap in security innovation!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Make an Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring Enterprise Account Executives to own the full sales cycle—from discovery to close—driving new business with enterprise customers who care deeply about developer productivity and application security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a technically complex, multi-threaded sale. Our buyers are CISOs, AppSec leaders, and engineering executives, and you&#39;ll translate Endor Labs&#39; capabilities into clear business value while partnering with Solution Architects, CS, SDRs, and Marketing. You won&#39;t inherit a full pipeline—you&#39;ll build it. The AEs who thrive here create demand and run a repeatable enterprise motion with intent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Cycle Ownership &amp;amp; Pipeline Generation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own complex, multi-stakeholder enterprise deals end to end, orchestrating SAs, CS, SDRs, and Marketing to win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-source a meaningful share of your pipeline through strategic, trigger-based prospecting—you create demand, you don&#39;t wait for it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value-Based Selling &amp;amp; MEDDPICC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run rigorous discovery and qualify with discipline using MEDDPICC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply a structured enterprise motion (e.g., Command of the Message) to move deals with purpose and predictability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Storytelling &amp;amp; Champion Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate technical depth into clear business outcomes and build a credible business case tied to measurable value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map the buying committee, build internal champions, and earn trusted-advisor status—you sell insight, not a feature checklist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecast Discipline &amp;amp; Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage pipeline rigorously, forecast with precision, and consistently exceed targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a fast-paced, high-growth environment—taking ownership over titles to win for the customer and the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring to the Table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re a strategic, technical seller who loves simplifying complexity and guiding customers through transformation. You know how to navigate ambiguity, collaborate deeply, and earn trust through insight and credibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of full-cycle enterprise sales experience in cybersecurity, DevOps, or developer tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of closing multi-threaded, six-figure deals with enterprise accounts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a structured, playbook-driven motion—Command of the Message, Force Management, MEDDPICC (or MEDDIC), or a comparable value-selling methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated over-attainment: President&#39;s Club, top-decile ranking, or a consistent record of beating quota.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve done your best work at high-growth companies where you had to &lt;em&gt;create&lt;/em&gt; demand, not fulfill inbound—and you know the difference.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort selling to technical buyers—CISOs, Heads of Security, Engineering and Developer Productivity leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High curiosity and initiative—you don&#39;t follow scripts, you lead the conversation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;The Bar We Hire To&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hold a bar above the market, and we&#39;re transparent about what it is. The best reps at Endor aren&#39;t defined by pedigree—they&#39;re defined by how they operate. We hire people who:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with character.&lt;/strong&gt; Commitment, humility, and grit. You&#39;ve overcome something hard, you want to be the best, and you carry a strong moral compass into every room.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are coachable by default.&lt;/strong&gt; You seek feedback, act on it fast, and treat every deal as a chance to get better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think sharply and translate complexity.&lt;/strong&gt; You build a credible business case and make hard concepts simple.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have proven it where it&#39;s hard.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve carried a number at a high-growth, not-yet-household-name company and consistently beaten it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Endor Labs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building at the intersection of developer productivity and security — one of the fastest-growing spaces in software. Our dev-loved platform has real ROI, strong momentum, and customers who care about doing things right.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Endor Labs, we think big, start small, and learn fast. We take ownership, move with purpose, and always start with the customer’s success. We debate with data, make the complex simple, and challenge each other with kindness and candor. We celebrate wins, learn from misses, and have fun along the way — because when our customers win, we all win.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Endor Labs is an Equal Opportunity Employer.&lt;/strong&gt; We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. Even if you don&#39;t fit every requirement above, we believe in the power of diverse perspectives and experiences, so we encourage all talented individuals to apply—there&#39;s no one-size-fits-all here.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Today’s most tomorrow company. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We run the most powerful battery on the grid, the 850MW Waratah Super Battery, and getting the next ones connected is your job.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are leading the energy transition towards a better, brighter tomorrow. The work you will do makes a real and very tangible impact on the future of the planet and its people. We’re 200 people around the world with 40 GWh of projects moving through development across Australia, Japan, the US and Germany.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We build, own, and operate our assets, we don’t hand a project to someone else once it’s approved. The people who design a battery site are the same people who build it and run it for the next twenty years.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;Y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;ou’ll lead our connection applications end to end, from first enquiry through to registration, working closely with Commercial and Engineering to get the settings right from day one.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead the Connection Application process end to end, including Connection Enquiries, Generator Performance Standards, design and modelling packages, validation, Hold Point testing and registration submissions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work with Business Developers and Engineering to optimise project designs, equipment selection and grid connection planning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Liaise directly with OEMs, external consultants and AEMO/NSPs, troubleshooting power system models and control system performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Negotiate technical performance standards with AEMO and NSPs, balancing our long-term operation of the asset against regulatory requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Keep across new rules and regulations, and help shape our responses to proposed changes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;How you’ll make a positive&amp;nbsp;impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
